						<h3>What is local SEO for lawyers?</h3>
						<p>Local SEO for lawyers is the practice of optimizing your firm to appear in location-based searches such as "personal injury lawyer near me" or "divorce attorney in Chicago." It includes Google Business Profile optimization, local citations, reviews, and geo-targeted content. AI search now incorporates local signals too, making <a href="/blog/local-seo-checklist-2026/">local SEO</a> critical for AI visibility.</p>
